  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Shelter and non-food items</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agency will continue to provide critical shelter and NFIs to displaced families, including tents, sealing and framing kits, mattresses, mats, blankets and kitchen sets for up to 1.2 million IDPs (240,000 families). UNRWA also plans to provide clothing to address the severe shortage of basic garments. When conditions permit, the Agency will carry out a rapid assessment of damaged UNRWA installations and undertake repairs to restore and strengthen its operational capacity wherever possible.</narrative>
  </description>
